# A place of the data given by two fields of the arguments Structure -- the first by position, `seen` by name -- makes
# the launch refuse with 5 before any effect. Answer 3 is for a named field that names no formal only (the decision of
# Sol 2026-11-25, CODER-SMALLFIX-20261125-01). Nothing of the body or of the right sides after the refusal runs: AFTER
# equals BEFORE.
@: Args (7; int: seen 8)
@: D (int: seen 0)
@: Code (
    seen := 1
)
int: before 0
int: after 0
before := 1
call(Args D Code)
after := 2
